        <activityName xml:lang="en">Inverter, for electric passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Inverter, for electric passenger car
This dataset describes an inverter used in the power electronics of the drivetrain for an electric passenger car. It is based on direct information from Swiss manufacturer Brusa. The entries are given as a function of kg device. The specific inverter which was used for this dataset weights 9.5 kg and is suitable for a 100kW electric drivetrain.;
UUID: 934d7e9d-2c5c-3bed-bd39-25342412bd01
&lt;null&gt;
Location: Unspecified
Technology: This dataset is based on current, high-level standard.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 85500 kg
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Data on materials and technology has been provided directly by the Swiss manufacturer Brusa. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_934d7e9d-2c5c-3bed-bd39-25342412bd01.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
